    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d105-a2">

                <pb facs="0219" n="115" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg115"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Secretary <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blaine</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>General Ezeta’s troops commenced assault on San Salvador, without notice, on
                    30th; on 31st broke open consulate, pulled down and carried away flag. I escaped
                    through boles made in back wall, running for life through heavy firing 2 miles.
                    Consulate and residence totally destroyed. Consider my life unsafe here; leave
                    for Washington on 5th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Myers</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Consul.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">San
                                Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-07-02"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 2,
                        1890</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
